# Workshop generic eligibility rubric

Score the candidate for a general technical workshop (0–100 total).

## Categories (required — use these exact keys)

### technical_skills (0–40)
Programming languages, frameworks, and tools demonstrated in skills list and work/projects.

### project_relevance (0–35)
Complexity and relevance of personal or team projects to software/technical work.

### prior_experience (0–25)
Internships, jobs, or substantial volunteer technical roles with real deliverables.

## Fairness
Do NOT score based on institution name, grades, gender, or location.

## Threshold guidance
- final_score ≥ 60 → APPROVE
- 40–59 → WAITLIST or MANUAL_REVIEW
- below 40 → REJECT

